emailTemplate vendor-rejection-mail (
    name: Vendor Rejection Mail
    emailSubject: Vendor Application Status
    htmlFormat {
        header: <b style="font-size: 24px;">Application Status</b>
        body:
            ```html
            Dear #VENDOR_NAME#,<br>
            
            Thank you for application! After careful review of your application and documents, our team has decided not to include you in our list of vendors. The reason for that is given below :
            <br>
            #REJ_REASON#
            
            
            
            
            ```
    }
